**Production test rule (unit + Cypress):** Tests must only delete or modify folders/files that the test itself created. Do not add test cases that: delete folders, permanently delete files, or delete/trash existing attachments or documents. Allowed: deleting only test-created data; read-only flows and stubbed data.
